# PlantUML diagram
@startuml
|Client|
start
:Prepare UserOperation;
:RPC call to
HC-enabled bundler;
|Bundler|
group eth_estimateUserOperationGas()
:Calculate verification gas;
:Calculate call gas
(first attempt);
|Sequencer|
:Simulate EVM execution
(Reverts);
|Bundler|
:Extract request parameters
from revert data;
:Call offchain
to registered URL;
|Offchain|
:Parse JSON-RPC request;
:Generate response payload
for offchain UserOperation;
:Return payload and signature;
|Bundler|
:Calculate call gas
(second attempt);
|Sequencer|
:Simulate EVM execution
with Storage override;
|Bundler|
:Update gas estimate,
store response to cache;
end group
|Client|
:Update UserOperation
gas limits;
:Sign and Submit;
|Bundler|
group eth_sendUserOperation()
:Insert into
proposed bundle;
if (Check cache
for HC data) then (found)
:Prepend Offchain
UserOperation;
else
endif
:Submit bundle;
|Sequencer|
:EntryPoint contract
processes bundle;
if (HC?) then (yes)
:HybridAccount calls
PutResponse();
:UserOperation execution
calls GetResponse()
through HybridAccount;
else (no)
:UserOperation
executes normally;
endif
|Bundler|
:Wait for block to be mined,
parse transaction receipt;
end group
|Client|
:Poll for result;
|Bundler|
:eth_getUserOperationReceipt();
|Client|
:Process receipt;
stop
@enduml
